# sabotage=CallsGiveNoArrayOtherStorage: a call that pushes onto a list is said to leave the storage of lists alone. The caller keeps the storage it has read across the call: the check in the compiled code stops the run
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: run-in-shell
# OPTIONS: heat=EverythingIsHot disable=pass:InlineCalls,pass:InlineHeads check=MovedLoads sabotage=CallsGiveNoArrayOtherStorage
# CHECK: AOT claim check: LoadMayMove
# PROGRAM-OF: calls-give-no-array-other-storage-left-alone.ir
